00:01:46.450 --> 00:01:51.700
Chapter 18 Rain

00:02:04.080 --> 00:02:08.330
"The sound of the bell
of Gion Shoja," is it?

00:02:08.330 --> 00:02:12.650
"The principle that those who
flourish must fall" is truly apt.

00:02:34.410 --> 00:02:36.380
What the hell's this?!

00:02:36.910 --> 00:02:41.010
Hey, hey, hey, are you serious?

00:02:41.290 --> 00:02:42.850
It's not like I have a choice.

00:02:42.850 --> 00:02:45.970
I didn't think it was going to rain.

00:02:46.750 --> 00:02:50.040
Even if you hang them up
in a stuffy room like this,

00:02:50.040 --> 00:02:52.330
they're not going to dry out completely.

00:02:52.330 --> 00:02:56.480
And then, you know, they get
this sour smell to them.

00:02:56.750 --> 00:02:58.910
It's bad enough already
that Ayu's not around

00:02:58.910 --> 00:03:01.450
and all we get is food
that tastes like crap.

00:03:01.790 --> 00:03:04.870
So, don't get some weird
smell going here too.

00:03:04.870 --> 00:03:07.830
Food that tastes like crap?

00:03:07.830 --> 00:03:12.750
Sano, might you be referring to
the meals that I've been cooking?

00:03:12.910 --> 00:03:15.750
Oh. No. Well...

00:03:15.750 --> 00:03:17.830
Did I say that?

00:03:17.830 --> 00:03:20.290
You <i>just </i>said it!
Huh? What are you talking about?

00:03:20.290 --> 00:03:25.510
What are you, a chicken?!
I wonder what's really going on with Ayu?

00:03:45.580 --> 00:03:46.830
Don't come in.

00:03:47.040 --> 00:03:48.060
You're an eyesore.

00:03:54.080 --> 00:03:55.830
Ayu...

00:03:55.830 --> 00:03:59.400
She hasn't come back here
at all this past week.

00:04:01.450 --> 00:04:05.370
I wanted to ask you about the
work she's doing right now...

00:04:05.370 --> 00:04:06.430
Dunno.

00:04:06.950 --> 00:04:09.370
Don't lie to me!

00:04:09.370 --> 00:04:12.060
Or do you really not even
know something like that?!

00:04:13.870 --> 00:04:17.080
Then, let me ask you this.

00:04:17.080 --> 00:04:18.770
Why're you asking me?

00:04:19.290 --> 00:04:22.200
Even if I asked Mr. Kondo or Mr. Hijikata,

00:04:22.200 --> 00:04:25.160
if they say they can't tell me,
that'd be the end of it.

00:04:25.160 --> 00:04:26.620
But with you,

00:04:27.160 --> 00:04:28.870
if I have to,

00:04:28.870 --> 00:04:30.830
I can beat the answer out
of you without holding back!

00:04:31.200 --> 00:04:34.040
Well, those're some mighty bold words.

00:04:37.830 --> 00:04:39.120
And?

00:04:39.120 --> 00:04:40.590
What're you gonna do once you know?

00:04:41.290 --> 00:04:45.970
You gonna pull the same kind of stunt
you pulled in front of Masuya before? Hm?

00:04:50.200 --> 00:04:55.850
Ayu might not be planning
to come back anymore.

00:04:56.080 --> 00:05:00.160
I don't know, but she was
saying some weird things...

00:05:00.160 --> 00:05:02.360
To me, while she was crying...

00:05:03.370 --> 00:05:04.220
So...

00:05:04.220 --> 00:05:05.390
So what?

00:05:07.580 --> 00:05:10.290
I'm asking you, so what?

00:05:10.290 --> 00:05:12.190
What do you wanna do about it?

00:05:14.830 --> 00:05:17.910
If that woman's doing some
sort of dangerous work,

00:05:17.910 --> 00:05:20.250
you planning to stop her?

00:05:20.250 --> 00:05:21.880
You're just a bratty sham of a page.

00:05:23.040 --> 00:05:25.920
Even if she might end up dying...

00:05:25.920 --> 00:05:26.680
Hey...

00:05:28.080 --> 00:05:30.620
if that's part of her job,

00:05:30.620 --> 00:05:32.680
you've got no right to stop her.

00:05:34.520 --> 00:05:35.560
Bastard!

00:05:35.870 --> 00:05:37.640
And you call yourself human?!

00:05:56.450 --> 00:05:59.250
I'll take that as a compliment.

00:06:00.700 --> 00:06:06.300
I don't have useless emotions
like that, after all.

00:06:13.250 --> 00:06:15.470
Oh, man.

00:06:15.830 --> 00:06:18.660
It's so annoying that it's raining.

00:06:18.660 --> 00:06:22.580
Really, you can't even
go out and have fun in this.

00:06:22.580 --> 00:06:24.150
That wouldn't change, even if it was sunny.

00:06:25.160 --> 00:06:30.660
Masuya's given us strict instructions
not to wander around outside.

00:06:30.660 --> 00:06:31.820
Oh, my.

00:06:32.580 --> 00:06:35.000
So, I've been cooped up for seven days now,

00:06:35.000 --> 00:06:38.830
in this musty house that feels
like it's been abandoned.

00:06:38.830 --> 00:06:40.830
Oh, my.

00:06:40.830 --> 00:06:44.160
I'd just assumed that
Masuya's business was booming

00:06:44.160 --> 00:06:48.130
and that's why he rented
out this place to expand.

00:06:50.620 --> 00:06:53.370
There got to be too many people,

00:06:53.370 --> 00:06:55.370
so he basically had to scramble

00:06:55.370 --> 00:06:58.140
to rent this place to have
somewhere to cram us.

00:06:58.830 --> 00:07:02.500
But still, it sure just keeps pouring.

00:07:02.500 --> 00:07:05.770
This humid air just gets on my nerves.

00:07:06.040 --> 00:07:07.470
Is that right?

00:07:08.790 --> 00:07:10.910
For my part,

00:07:10.910 --> 00:07:15.370
I like this damp kind of atmosphere.

00:07:15.790 --> 00:07:18.540
Since it's humid anyway,

00:07:18.540 --> 00:07:20.040
wouldn't the two of us getting together...

00:07:20.040 --> 00:07:22.640
and getting all drenched...

00:07:22.640 --> 00:07:26.060
be something enjoyable for us to do?

00:07:26.910 --> 00:07:28.160
No doubt about it.

00:07:29.250 --> 00:07:30.620
No doubt about it!

00:07:47.690 --> 00:07:49.070
Die!

00:07:56.040 --> 00:07:58.830
You damn Mibu ronin!

00:08:05.540 --> 00:08:06.620
Mr. Hijikata.

00:08:08.160 --> 00:08:10.870
Are you all right, Soji?

00:08:10.870 --> 00:08:12.220
What about you?

00:08:19.290 --> 00:08:20.270
You'll get wet.

00:08:23.330 --> 00:08:26.030
I'm already soaked to the bone.

00:08:27.620 --> 00:08:29.080
I don't like this.

00:08:29.080 --> 00:08:30.030
What?

00:08:30.750 --> 00:08:33.540
They've been holding
their breath all this time.

00:08:33.540 --> 00:08:36.450
Now, it may be raining, but they're
out walking in broad daylight.

00:08:36.450 --> 00:08:37.750
And of all things,

00:08:37.750 --> 00:08:40.040
even knowing that we are Shinsengumi,

00:08:40.250 --> 00:08:42.040
they drew their swords against us.

00:08:42.290 --> 00:08:45.260
We should have kept them alive
and interrogated them.

00:08:46.410 --> 00:08:47.500
It can't be helped.

00:08:48.250 --> 00:08:50.750
They aren't the country samurai
we've dealt with in the past.

00:08:50.750 --> 00:08:54.840
If we'd hesitated, they may
have gotten us instead.

00:08:56.330 --> 00:09:00.830
Did they bare their fangs against
us precisely for that reason?

00:09:00.830 --> 00:09:02.160
Or...

00:09:02.160 --> 00:09:03.140
Or?

00:09:04.290 --> 00:09:08.560
Are they simply impatient
for the sight of blood?

00:09:12.080 --> 00:09:15.000
I just hope there are no
incidents that develop...

00:09:37.120 --> 00:09:38.000
Suzu.

00:09:39.540 --> 00:09:40.510
Master?

00:09:40.870 --> 00:09:42.600
You can stay where you are.

00:09:42.910 --> 00:09:44.520
I will be going out for a bit.

00:09:44.520 --> 00:09:47.040
Then I shall accompany you.

00:09:47.040 --> 00:09:48.690
You stay.

00:09:49.660 --> 00:09:52.250
I am your page, Master!

00:09:52.250 --> 00:09:55.330
If you are going out, I will
go anywhere with you!

00:09:55.330 --> 00:09:59.030
It seems the samurai are
growing a little impatient.

00:09:59.580 --> 00:10:03.040
There may be some who
will act inappropriately.

00:10:03.040 --> 00:10:04.450
Act inappropriately?

00:10:04.700 --> 00:10:09.330
That goes for Masuya...
no, Furutaka as well.

00:10:09.700 --> 00:10:12.200
You watch them.

00:10:12.200 --> 00:10:13.750
And you, Master?

00:10:13.750 --> 00:10:17.670
I will go see Miyabe and Matsuda
with no one else to disturb us.

00:10:17.950 --> 00:10:20.550
Before the festival, as it were.

00:10:20.550 --> 00:10:21.970
Master Miyabe as well?!

00:10:22.790 --> 00:10:25.410
He is already hiding in Kyoto.

00:10:25.410 --> 00:10:27.480
Then, it's happening at long last!

00:10:27.950 --> 00:10:29.240
The time is near.

00:10:30.080 --> 00:10:34.440
However, it would be bad if the Mibu ronin were
to catch the drift of our activities before then.

00:10:35.910 --> 00:10:36.900
You understand?

00:10:37.290 --> 00:10:38.450
Yes, sir!

00:10:38.450 --> 00:10:39.760
And Suzu...

00:10:41.290 --> 00:10:44.750
Before the festival happens,

00:10:44.750 --> 00:10:48.960
you must sever your connection
with the tainted one.

00:10:50.660 --> 00:10:53.450
The final banquet will begin soon.

00:10:53.450 --> 00:10:55.500
The guests of honor are assembled.

00:10:55.500 --> 00:10:57.660
We cannot postpone it at this late hour.

00:11:01.250 --> 00:11:06.600
So, looking out at the world from a window with
a narrow view will tell me nothing, was it?

00:11:07.610 --> 00:11:08.170
Sir?

00:11:10.120 --> 00:11:11.540
Do not mind me.

00:11:11.540 --> 00:11:15.720
It was just some nonsense spoken
by a man who dresses like a fool.

00:11:35.620 --> 00:11:38.450
It's really coming down
persistently, isn't it?

00:11:38.450 --> 00:11:39.800
Yes, it is.

00:11:40.950 --> 00:11:44.760
It's still early for the
rainy season, though.

00:11:48.500 --> 00:11:51.890
But whatever happened?

00:11:53.000 --> 00:11:58.040
The puppy boy isn't his
usual energetic self today.

00:11:58.040 --> 00:11:59.860
I know...

00:12:00.080 --> 00:12:04.700
I thought it might cheer
him up some to come here,

00:12:04.700 --> 00:12:07.750
so I dragged him along
against his will, but...

00:12:07.750 --> 00:12:08.700
My...

00:12:08.910 --> 00:12:12.500
It seems there's something
that's been bothering him.

00:12:12.500 --> 00:12:13.670
What's that?

00:12:17.000 --> 00:12:19.310
Don't you think walking in the rain
together under one umbrella

00:12:19.310 --> 00:12:22.920
would be a fanciful thing
to do from time to time?

00:12:25.540 --> 00:12:28.390
Let's give those two young people
some time alone together.

00:12:30.540 --> 00:12:32.390
That sounds like a fine idea.

00:12:36.540 --> 00:12:40.040
This sort of thing has
its own charm, doesn't it?

00:12:40.040 --> 00:12:41.190
Yeah.

00:12:41.660 --> 00:12:44.600
So, just what happened?

00:12:46.000 --> 00:12:47.070
Well...

00:12:48.190 --> 00:12:52.120
A woman who takes care of
our meals at headquarters

00:12:52.120 --> 00:12:56.450
hasn't been seen these last couple days.

00:12:56.450 --> 00:12:57.080
My...

00:12:57.790 --> 00:13:00.040
Tetsu isn't the only one.

00:13:00.040 --> 00:13:05.620
Though they may not say so,
it seems everyone is worried.

00:13:05.620 --> 00:13:07.550
I had no idea...

00:13:10.410 --> 00:13:11.310
But...

00:13:12.330 --> 00:13:15.750
How enviable.

00:13:15.750 --> 00:13:18.790
Having everyone worried for her...

00:13:18.790 --> 00:13:23.410
She must really be loved.

00:13:23.410 --> 00:13:24.490
Yeah.

00:13:24.870 --> 00:13:27.110
Not like me.

00:13:34.370 --> 00:13:37.290
How forlorn it is...

00:13:37.290 --> 00:13:39.420
to be all alone.

00:13:42.910 --> 00:13:46.500
Are you serious?
Sorry, but we've already decided.

00:13:46.500 --> 00:13:48.660
We aren't like you.

00:13:48.660 --> 00:13:51.890
Loyalist, exclusionist,
it doesn't matter to us.

00:13:52.290 --> 00:13:54.160
Have you forgotten the past?

00:13:56.080 --> 00:13:57.450
What's so funny?!

00:13:57.450 --> 00:13:59.480
That's no concern of ours!

00:14:00.700 --> 00:14:03.400
We are alive, here and now.

00:14:03.400 --> 00:14:04.860
That's our reason.

00:14:05.870 --> 00:14:08.000
Kiemon Masuya...

00:14:08.000 --> 00:14:11.450
No, Shuntaro Furutaka is growing impatient.

00:14:11.450 --> 00:14:15.640
His dealings with Toshimaro Yoshida
will likely unravel in time as well.

00:14:17.370 --> 00:14:20.000
Our work is done here.

00:14:20.000 --> 00:14:22.870
So, what are you going to do?

00:14:22.870 --> 00:14:25.750
Oh, I wonder what we should do?

00:14:25.750 --> 00:14:29.130
We could just become
Shogunate hounds. That's one option.

00:14:29.910 --> 00:14:32.750
Basically, clinging to
the ghosts of the past

00:14:32.750 --> 00:14:36.040
won't win your meals for tomorrow.

00:14:36.040 --> 00:14:37.810
It's nothing personal.

00:14:54.660 --> 00:14:57.700
I'm all alone.

00:14:57.700 --> 00:15:00.620
That's not true, Akesato.

00:15:01.330 --> 00:15:03.660
You have me, remember?

00:15:03.660 --> 00:15:07.200
Thank you, Mister Yamanami.

00:15:07.200 --> 00:15:09.470
But...
But?

00:15:10.000 --> 00:15:15.870
You have lots of comrades
among the Shinsengumi as well,

00:15:15.870 --> 00:15:18.940
but I only have you.

00:15:19.910 --> 00:15:21.420
Not really.

00:15:24.950 --> 00:15:27.700
There are times when I'm among my comrades

00:15:27.700 --> 00:15:31.820
that I realize all the more
poignantly how alone I am.

00:15:32.950 --> 00:15:35.370
Even more so than when I'm by myself.

00:15:37.000 --> 00:15:42.750
Then, you and I are both the same.

00:15:45.160 --> 00:15:49.180
We're both the same kind of lonely people.

00:15:53.290 --> 00:15:55.890
Isn't that right, Mister Yamanami?

00:16:01.200 --> 00:16:03.980
Yes, you're right.

00:16:19.000 --> 00:16:20.870
Am I okay?

00:16:23.080 --> 00:16:25.290
You're trying to cheer me up, right?

00:16:26.580 --> 00:16:27.760
Thanks, really.

00:16:29.250 --> 00:16:35.450
I wasn't planning on griping
like this in front of you.

00:16:37.540 --> 00:16:39.560
Say, Saya...

00:16:40.620 --> 00:16:42.010
But I...

00:16:45.950 --> 00:16:48.760
Even then, I'm still afraid.

00:16:51.160 --> 00:16:55.200
I don't want to say goodbye to
people I've gotten to be friends with.

00:17:01.200 --> 00:17:03.080
Hey.

00:17:03.080 --> 00:17:06.080
Saya, what are you doing?

00:17:08.950 --> 00:17:10.050
Saya...

00:17:16.290 --> 00:17:17.950
Sorry.

00:17:17.950 --> 00:17:25.980
I just remembered a time long ago
when I laid my head in my mom's lap.

00:17:26.660 --> 00:17:27.580
Say...

00:17:29.700 --> 00:17:33.360
Do you mind if I stay like
this for a while longer?

00:17:40.080 --> 00:17:43.330
It's night and it still
hasn't let up, has it?

00:17:43.330 --> 00:17:44.790
Yeah.

00:17:44.790 --> 00:17:48.830
Though I'm kind of in the mood to go
out to Shimabara or something for once.

00:17:49.790 --> 00:17:53.160
Shut away in this murky place...

00:17:53.160 --> 00:17:55.470
What a sorry fate for such a fine man.

00:17:57.200 --> 00:17:58.830
You said it.

00:17:58.830 --> 00:18:03.370
Well, there're plenty
of guys like that here.

00:18:03.370 --> 00:18:05.850
But I sure had fun here.

00:18:09.200 --> 00:18:12.940
When you need your hair
done again, would you call on me?

00:18:14.120 --> 00:18:15.530
Sorry.

00:18:17.250 --> 00:18:21.580
We've been told not to get
too involved with women.

00:18:21.580 --> 00:18:24.140
Because women are scary.

00:18:25.370 --> 00:18:26.500
Oh, my.

00:18:27.080 --> 00:18:28.790
Come to think of it, lately...

00:18:29.870 --> 00:18:34.060
the Masuya owner's been
saying he's getting real annoyed...

00:18:37.660 --> 00:18:40.470
with a woman who has
a mole under her eye...

00:18:41.870 --> 00:18:44.510
and comes to do our
hair to get information.

00:19:00.250 --> 00:19:05.030
Please don't think ill of us,
Miss Yumi the hairdresser.

00:19:05.540 --> 00:19:15.040
Or should I call you by your
real name, Ayumu Yamazaki?

00:19:41.290 --> 00:19:43.120
I see.

00:19:43.120 --> 00:19:45.540
You are quite skilled.

00:19:45.540 --> 00:19:49.830
It seems we must treat you accordingly.

00:19:56.250 --> 00:19:57.540
What shall we do?

00:19:57.540 --> 00:19:59.330
First, get Master Yoshida and...

00:19:59.330 --> 00:20:01.220
The Master is not here.

00:20:01.620 --> 00:20:02.720
No, no.

00:20:04.000 --> 00:20:09.180
We need not disturb the Master
over such a trivial matter.

00:20:09.500 --> 00:20:10.680
Then...

00:20:11.540 --> 00:20:14.540
You men may do with her as you wish.

00:20:16.580 --> 00:20:17.440
However...

00:20:19.540 --> 00:20:22.410
Be careful when you discard her.

00:20:35.040 --> 00:20:36.190
Susumu...

00:20:49.080 --> 00:20:52.360
Sheesh, rain again today?

00:20:54.200 --> 00:20:58.360
Ayu didn't come back yesterday, either.

00:21:00.200 --> 00:21:02.580
Even if it's just a little,

00:21:02.580 --> 00:21:06.040
be friends with him for me someday.

00:21:06.040 --> 00:21:11.310
Because I'm sure you're the only
one he can have fights with too.

00:21:13.450 --> 00:21:16.870
It's impossible, Ayu.

00:21:17.950 --> 00:21:22.040
I can only...

00:21:22.040 --> 00:21:24.810
make him mad.

00:21:27.700 --> 00:21:29.080
The Commander!

